WEBVTT

00:14.590 --> 00:16.110
This is good,

00:16.550 --> 00:18.680
but not as thrilling as riding a horse.

00:19.430 --> 00:20.710
I heard you

00:20.730 --> 00:23.370
smashed the Second Batou's Xuande Jar.

00:25.950 --> 00:27.180
He's quick to talk.

00:29.180 --> 00:30.380
Good job smashing it.

00:30.660 --> 00:32.340
To do big business,

00:32.470 --> 00:34.040
you have to be willing to invest.

00:34.040 --> 00:35.530
What you say makes sense.

00:35.830 --> 00:36.830
Then how about

00:37.470 --> 00:38.910
you add some more capital?

00:38.910 --> 00:39.790
Sure.

00:41.270 --> 00:42.910
What do I get?

00:43.020 --> 00:44.350
I'll get you a new house.

00:44.620 --> 00:45.750
And an American car,

00:46.740 --> 00:48.060
how about that?

00:48.270 --> 00:49.270
So generous?

00:49.660 --> 00:50.550
Sure.

00:50.700 --> 00:51.870
That's wonderful.

00:53.130 --> 00:53.890
So filial.

00:54.090 --> 00:56.040
Who taught you to be so filial?

00:56.070 --> 00:58.150
Your mother or your mentor?

01:08.020 --> 01:09.820
Living under someone else's roof,

01:09.820 --> 01:10.990
I have no choice.

01:11.460 --> 01:12.580
Poor thing.

01:18.100 --> 01:19.350
Wanna try?

03:10.450 --> 03:14.220
[A Prophet]

03:15.030 --> 03:17.370
[Episode 15]

03:19.070 --> 03:20.070
This old eunuch

03:20.070 --> 03:22.930
insists the thumb ring
Fifth Master gave us is fake.

03:23.230 --> 03:24.190
And...

03:28.700 --> 03:29.790
What are you looking at me for?

03:29.790 --> 03:30.750
Go on.

03:33.910 --> 03:34.750
Second Master,

03:34.750 --> 03:35.510
he said

03:35.510 --> 03:37.450
the real dragon throne
should have a crack underneath,

03:37.450 --> 03:39.450
caused by Emperor Xuantong's kick.

03:42.910 --> 03:44.240
What are you looking at?

03:44.660 --> 03:46.980
How would I know Xuantong
kicked the dragon throne?

03:46.980 --> 03:49.450
Second Brother,
your craftsmanship is flawless.

03:49.450 --> 03:50.250
Masters,

03:50.270 --> 03:52.430
this eunuch is clearly coming for us.

03:52.460 --> 03:53.710
If he exposes the scam,

03:53.710 --> 03:54.990
we're all doomed.

03:57.760 --> 04:00.010
I told you to pull out, but you didn't.

04:00.030 --> 04:01.900
Now his wife is back
to mess things up.

04:01.900 --> 04:02.650
I think

04:03.030 --> 04:04.540
the 70% cut is gone.

04:04.860 --> 04:05.420
t1

04:08.230 --> 04:09.030
Sixth Master,

04:09.630 --> 04:11.030
it's your turn.

04:17.260 --> 04:18.630
Don't boss me around.

04:18.779 --> 04:20.190
I'll settle the score with you

04:20.190 --> 04:21.670
after this game.

04:34.430 --> 04:35.230
Your Majesty.

04:39.670 --> 04:40.550
Madam.

04:41.070 --> 04:41.950
Honey?

04:42.510 --> 04:43.900
Honey, why are you here?

04:44.220 --> 04:47.280
-Greetings, Your Majesty.
-Greetings, Your Majesty.

04:49.070 --> 04:49.990
Rise.

04:52.380 --> 04:54.670
You guys put on quite a show.

04:54.900 --> 04:57.020
You bunch of swindlers.

04:57.820 --> 04:58.870
And you—

04:58.870 --> 05:00.670
you little vixen.

05:00.670 --> 05:02.580
I'll make sure you don't
leave here alive today.

05:02.580 --> 05:03.510
Watch how I deal with you—

05:03.510 --> 05:04.020
What are you doing?

05:04.020 --> 05:05.140
You're asking me what I'm doing?

05:05.140 --> 05:06.340
What are you doing?

05:07.340 --> 05:08.140
Cao San!

05:08.160 --> 05:09.840
You absolute fool.

05:10.070 --> 05:11.570
I brought the eunuch here today.

05:11.570 --> 05:13.490
Your pipe dream is over!

05:14.130 --> 05:15.890
And you swindlers—

05:16.550 --> 05:18.220
none of you will get away!

05:18.220 --> 05:18.550
Madam.

05:18.550 --> 05:19.380
Your Majesty.

05:19.380 --> 05:20.110
You...

05:20.110 --> 05:21.140
Madam.

05:21.140 --> 05:22.190
Calm down.

05:22.190 --> 05:23.380
Let me see.

05:31.870 --> 05:33.430
Back when

05:33.580 --> 05:35.550
the Eight-Nation Alliance
entered the capital,

05:35.550 --> 05:36.670
a German barbarian

05:36.700 --> 05:39.820
named Waldersee

05:39.840 --> 05:41.640
acted wildly in the palace.

05:41.670 --> 05:42.940
Not only did he sit on the dragon throne,

05:42.940 --> 05:45.540
but he also had his servants
take a photo of him.

05:46.820 --> 05:49.220
In the end, he was decapitated

05:49.550 --> 05:51.010
and died a gruesome death.

05:51.220 --> 05:53.870
He didn't even know how he died.

05:54.580 --> 05:56.460
The authentic Dragon Throne

05:56.990 --> 05:58.250
is a national treasure

05:58.510 --> 05:59.780
that converges

05:59.780 --> 06:02.510
the Three Powers
of Heaven, Earth, and Humanity.

06:04.340 --> 06:07.140
It's full of Yang energy.

06:07.700 --> 06:08.580
So,

06:08.780 --> 06:10.580
anyone who usurps the throne

06:11.020 --> 06:12.310
will die a horrible death.

06:12.310 --> 06:13.110
Did you hear that?

06:13.110 --> 06:14.110
A horrible death.

06:14.260 --> 06:15.310
Sect Leader Cao,

06:15.510 --> 06:17.630
if this is the real dragon throne,

06:18.950 --> 06:21.430
I advise you not to touch it.

06:35.550 --> 06:37.510
He is that Eastern dragon!

06:37.550 --> 06:37.950
Quick,

06:38.020 --> 06:39.220
protect the Emperor!

06:46.700 --> 06:48.100
Watch out, Your Majesty!

06:49.510 --> 06:50.770
My beloved concubine.

06:53.950 --> 06:54.820
My beloved concubine.

06:54.820 --> 06:56.220
Cao San.

06:57.870 --> 06:58.460
Doggie,

06:58.700 --> 06:59.900
protect the Emperor!

06:59.990 --> 07:00.380
Honey!

07:00.380 --> 07:00.870
Cao San.

07:00.870 --> 07:01.110
Honey!

07:01.110 --> 07:01.700
They...

07:14.510 --> 07:15.380
Drop the act.

07:16.040 --> 07:17.640
Let's all go back to the hall.

07:25.460 --> 07:26.520
What are you doing?

07:26.670 --> 07:28.130
There's one we didn't use.

07:29.780 --> 07:32.220
State Preceptor!

07:32.310 --> 07:33.990
Open the door! State Preceptor!

07:33.990 --> 07:35.140
Quick!

07:35.340 --> 07:36.340
State Preceptor!

07:36.820 --> 07:37.820
What happened?

07:37.820 --> 07:38.990
The bed!

07:38.990 --> 07:40.020
Over here.

07:40.730 --> 07:41.900
I'm fine.

07:42.290 --> 07:43.950
Quickly, check if His Majesty

07:44.260 --> 07:45.460
is hurt.

07:45.460 --> 07:46.580
What exactly happened?

07:46.580 --> 07:47.780
Some people suddenly rushed in.

07:47.780 --> 07:49.040
They looked Japanese.

07:49.140 --> 07:50.510
They started shooting right away,

07:50.510 --> 07:52.510
almost hurting His Majesty.

07:52.670 --> 07:53.460
Your Majesty!

07:53.460 --> 07:54.050
Your Majesty!

07:54.050 --> 07:55.780
Let me check if you're injured.

07:56.100 --> 07:57.340
I'm fine.

07:57.670 --> 07:59.670
Go find a doctor for Miss Jiang

07:59.670 --> 08:01.340
immediately.

08:01.880 --> 08:02.600
No,

08:02.620 --> 08:04.420
that will attract the Japanese.

08:04.480 --> 08:05.940
An assassination attempt

08:05.980 --> 08:08.340
means His Majesty's identity
and whereabouts are exposed.

08:08.340 --> 08:09.460
The most important thing now

08:09.460 --> 08:11.630
is to move His Majesty to a safe place.

08:11.630 --> 08:12.900
Your Majesty, your health is the priority.

08:12.900 --> 08:14.260
As your subjects,

08:14.510 --> 08:17.070
it's our duty even if we die.

08:17.310 --> 08:18.210
Yes, Your Majesty.

08:18.210 --> 08:19.060
Exactly.

08:19.240 --> 08:21.370
It's our duty to risk our lives for you,

08:21.550 --> 08:23.460
Your Majesty.

08:23.460 --> 08:24.510
I'm fine.

08:25.110 --> 08:26.550
Duty?

08:26.670 --> 08:27.780
My goodness,

08:28.190 --> 08:29.820
you bunch of frauds.

08:29.820 --> 08:31.430
Your Majesty!

08:31.700 --> 08:32.419
Don't...

08:32.419 --> 08:33.090
Don't get up.

08:33.090 --> 08:34.690
Greetings, Your Majesty...

08:35.700 --> 08:36.770
Get up!

08:39.110 --> 08:41.510
Where did this little street rat
come from?

08:42.340 --> 08:43.460
First time seeing you.

08:43.460 --> 08:46.060
You must be the leader of these frauds.

08:47.150 --> 08:48.550
Calm down, Your Majesty.

08:48.620 --> 08:51.100
I am completely loyal to the Emperor.

08:51.330 --> 08:52.920
Still acting in front of me?

08:52.950 --> 08:54.500
You guys really love acting.

08:54.500 --> 08:55.580
If you love it so much,

08:55.580 --> 08:57.920
I'll build a stage for you
to act all you want.

08:57.920 --> 08:59.520
And you, you little vixen,

08:59.550 --> 09:01.260
finally showing your true colors.

09:01.260 --> 09:02.790
How dare you steal my man?

09:02.810 --> 09:04.020
Do you know

09:04.050 --> 09:05.960
I saved this man's life?

09:06.600 --> 09:07.660
What are you doing?

09:09.220 --> 09:09.980
Your Majesty,

09:09.980 --> 09:11.070
are you okay?

09:11.740 --> 09:12.620
Enough!

09:13.700 --> 09:14.700
Cao San!

09:14.820 --> 09:16.390
You dare hit me

09:16.390 --> 09:17.670
for this vixen?

09:17.670 --> 09:19.270
She's not a vixen.

09:19.550 --> 09:20.390
Look at

09:20.700 --> 09:23.460
how badly she's hurt for me.

09:23.620 --> 09:24.740
And them—

09:25.150 --> 09:27.500
they are all my loyal subjects.

09:27.790 --> 09:30.320
-Your Majesty is wise.
-Your Majesty is wise.

09:30.980 --> 09:32.190
My god...

09:32.340 --> 09:33.150
Oh my goodness!

09:33.150 --> 09:34.910
You've all really gone mad!

09:36.870 --> 09:37.710
Eunuch.

09:38.550 --> 09:39.670
Quick, tell him

09:39.790 --> 09:40.950
they are all frauds.

09:40.950 --> 09:42.480
That dragon throne is fake.

09:44.620 --> 09:45.620
Say something!

09:45.620 --> 09:47.030
Speak up!

09:52.210 --> 09:54.920
Which banner are you from?

10:04.410 --> 10:06.070
I am of the Plain White Banner,

10:06.120 --> 10:07.780
with the Manchu surname Fuca.

10:09.700 --> 10:10.460
Madam,

10:11.430 --> 10:12.460
I've taken a look.

10:12.580 --> 10:14.030
That dragon throne

10:14.030 --> 10:14.910
is real.

10:14.910 --> 10:17.390
It's the very one
from the Hall of Supreme Harmony.

10:17.390 --> 10:18.030
Look,

10:18.050 --> 10:20.050
I've been looking at it for over 20 years.

10:20.050 --> 10:21.190
I wouldn't be mistaken.

10:21.190 --> 10:22.070
Impossible.

10:22.950 --> 10:24.640
These people are all scammers.

10:24.640 --> 10:26.400
I just asked them in Manchu,

10:26.490 --> 10:28.300
and they really are Bannermen.

10:28.640 --> 10:30.490
You're in cahoots with them.

10:30.520 --> 10:31.520
You old scammer!

10:32.210 --> 10:32.890
Madam,

10:32.910 --> 10:34.780
you asked me to come
and appraise it for you.

10:34.780 --> 10:36.780
I was in the palace for over 20 years.

10:36.910 --> 10:38.310
Even the masters couldn't bear

10:38.310 --> 10:39.670
to lay a finger on me.

10:39.670 --> 10:40.670
And you actually...

10:40.670 --> 10:41.500
All right.

10:41.910 --> 10:43.460
Even the eunuch you found

10:43.670 --> 10:45.500
said the throne was real.

10:45.500 --> 10:47.740
What else is there to say?

10:47.740 --> 10:49.740
Can't you wish me well?

10:49.760 --> 10:51.550
How can I make you Empress

10:52.030 --> 10:53.790
when you're acting like this?

10:53.980 --> 10:54.690
Your Majesty.

10:54.690 --> 10:55.500
Don't pull me!

10:55.540 --> 10:57.100
Your Majesty, please stop arguing.

10:57.100 --> 10:58.250
Her Majesty

10:58.280 --> 11:00.610
is just unable to accept this so suddenly.

11:00.790 --> 11:02.010
Please don't blame her.

11:02.010 --> 11:03.560
Get away, you little vixen!

11:05.150 --> 11:06.390
I'll kill you.

11:06.410 --> 11:07.960
Still seducing him, huh?

11:08.310 --> 11:10.260
Are you trying to rebel?

11:10.460 --> 11:11.580
How dare you hit me!

11:11.620 --> 11:12.460
Someone!

11:12.860 --> 11:14.820
Summon the imperial physician for me!

11:14.820 --> 11:15.460
Cao San!

11:15.700 --> 11:16.950
You're ridiculous!

11:17.910 --> 11:19.310
Calm down, Your Majesty.

11:19.460 --> 11:20.430
Calm down, Your Majesty.

11:20.430 --> 11:21.190
Your Majesty!

11:21.190 --> 11:21.990
Your Majesty!

11:24.920 --> 11:25.890
It's done.

11:26.620 --> 11:27.740
Scammer.

11:27.910 --> 11:29.030
Scammer.

11:33.150 --> 11:34.070
Miss Jiang,

11:34.460 --> 11:35.790
I need you to promise me.

11:36.340 --> 11:38.100
You must recover well.

11:39.090 --> 11:40.090
State Preceptor.

11:40.150 --> 11:42.670
I'm leaving Miss Jiang in your care.

11:42.860 --> 11:44.460
You must cure her.

11:44.620 --> 11:46.220
Rest assured, Your Majesty.

11:47.430 --> 11:49.190
Cao San, come out!

11:49.210 --> 11:50.480
You blockhead.

11:50.700 --> 11:52.430
You've lost your mind.

11:53.690 --> 11:55.270
I haven't even ascended the throne yet,

11:55.270 --> 11:57.670
and the harem is already this noisy.

11:59.820 --> 12:01.080
My beloved concubine,

12:01.340 --> 12:02.740
recover well.

12:02.890 --> 12:05.250
I will come see you again tomorrow.

12:05.340 --> 12:06.150
Your Majesty,

12:06.820 --> 12:08.190
don't worry.

12:20.310 --> 12:21.620
I didn't expect

12:22.580 --> 12:26.980
this gold-lacquered carved dragon throne
really has the aura of a true dragon.

12:26.980 --> 12:28.580
I said it had a crack,

12:29.640 --> 12:31.610
and it actually did.

12:35.220 --> 12:36.220
May I ask, Eunuch,

12:36.910 --> 12:38.240
what do you mean by that?

12:38.620 --> 12:39.980
I deliberately said

12:40.030 --> 12:41.960
that the dragon throne had a crack.

12:42.150 --> 12:43.740
Those who don't know better

12:43.820 --> 12:45.220
would think this dragon throne

12:45.220 --> 12:47.030
is made of golden thread nanmu.

12:47.820 --> 12:50.100
But the main material of the dragon throne

12:50.100 --> 12:51.460
is brass.

12:52.100 --> 12:54.410
Can a child really crack

12:54.440 --> 12:57.530
a gold-painted brass dragon chair
with a kick?

13:01.860 --> 13:03.500
You bunch of frauds.

13:04.190 --> 13:06.320
You're still not taking it seriously.

13:09.430 --> 13:11.520
Whether we're taking it seriously or not

13:11.520 --> 13:12.800
depends on if you can

13:13.150 --> 13:14.790
walk out that door today.

13:18.150 --> 13:18.670
What?

13:19.430 --> 13:20.760
You're going to kill me?

13:21.700 --> 13:22.430
Fine.

13:23.220 --> 13:24.620
Once I die,

13:25.030 --> 13:26.030
it won't be long

13:26.310 --> 13:27.970
before Cao San figures it out.

13:29.420 --> 13:32.750
Trading my old life
with one foot in the grave

13:32.920 --> 13:34.090
for yours

13:35.460 --> 13:36.700
is worth it.

13:37.740 --> 13:38.620
Old sir,

13:39.340 --> 13:40.190
why...

13:40.860 --> 13:41.920
are you doing this?

13:42.150 --> 13:43.070
Very simple.

13:43.700 --> 13:44.700
Let's make a deal.

13:45.550 --> 13:46.340
Interested?

13:47.700 --> 13:48.700
What kind of deal?

13:50.980 --> 13:52.410
Help me kill Cao San.

13:56.270 --> 13:56.860
Eunuch,

13:57.550 --> 13:58.100
this will

13:58.630 --> 14:01.150
start a blood feud with the Beggar Sect.

14:01.790 --> 14:03.030
I am a eunuch

14:04.220 --> 14:05.430
with no sons or daughters.

14:05.430 --> 14:08.160
I went back to my hometown
and adopted 2 children.

14:08.620 --> 14:10.880
A few years ago,
I took them to the street,

14:11.790 --> 14:13.460
and they suddenly went missing.

14:13.460 --> 14:16.190
I searched for a long time
but couldn't find them.

14:18.990 --> 14:21.580
A few months ago, I saw them

14:22.670 --> 14:24.340
begging on the street.

14:26.580 --> 14:28.580
They were completely crippled!

14:30.030 --> 14:31.430
Dirty work like this

14:31.580 --> 14:33.460
was done by Cao San and his gang.

14:34.070 --> 14:36.190
I just want to see those bastards

14:36.190 --> 14:39.220
go to hell with my own eyes.

14:39.440 --> 14:41.410
Then you could just find a chance

14:41.980 --> 14:43.820
to trade your life for his.

14:44.030 --> 14:45.230
Why drag us into this?

14:46.100 --> 14:47.860
Since we have a common enemy,

14:48.310 --> 14:49.950
then we are friends now.

14:51.550 --> 14:52.340
This is a deal

14:53.700 --> 14:54.550
then.

14:55.390 --> 14:56.580
It's a deal.

14:56.670 --> 14:57.820
It's a deal.

14:58.310 --> 14:59.220
Shangguan Chengming.

14:59.220 --> 15:00.730
Since ancient times,

15:00.760 --> 15:02.620
Tianxiang Sect has been setting things up

15:02.620 --> 15:03.740
to make money.

15:04.270 --> 15:05.030
At first,

15:05.150 --> 15:06.700
you wanted to sell fake treasures
to make money.

15:06.700 --> 15:08.430
I gave you the Xuande Jar
without a second thought,

15:08.430 --> 15:09.070
right?

15:09.460 --> 15:09.950
Then,

15:10.310 --> 15:12.980
the jar was smashed,
and I didn't see a single dime.

15:12.980 --> 15:13.510
And then,

15:13.740 --> 15:15.580
you wanted to sell some pipe dream.

15:15.580 --> 15:15.980
Fine.

15:16.180 --> 15:17.840
I made a dragon throne for you.

15:17.910 --> 15:18.430
Now,

15:18.860 --> 15:20.400
you want to destroy the Beggar Sect.

15:20.400 --> 15:21.100
Let me ask you,

15:21.100 --> 15:22.980
are you playing us for fools?

15:23.580 --> 15:25.580
It's a pity if you don't lie to a fool.

15:25.820 --> 15:26.420
Calm down,

15:26.950 --> 15:27.810
Second Master.

15:28.390 --> 15:29.640
How could this scam not make money?

15:29.640 --> 15:30.500
C-Cut the crap.

15:31.190 --> 15:32.700
Compensate me for the Xuande Jar first.

15:32.700 --> 15:33.550
I will after we finish this.

15:33.550 --> 15:35.010
Do it yourself if you want.

15:35.390 --> 15:36.070
I quit.

15:37.270 --> 15:38.200
Second Brother.

15:38.270 --> 15:38.620
Hey—

15:43.500 --> 15:45.500
Sixth Brother, why don't we just

15:45.520 --> 15:47.240
call off this scam?

15:47.740 --> 15:50.090
If Shangguan Chengming
keeps making trouble,

15:50.090 --> 15:52.310
I'm afraid he'll drag down
the whole Tianxiang Sect.

15:52.310 --> 15:53.740
If anything goes wrong,

15:53.790 --> 15:55.990
how can we explain it to the Sect Master?

15:56.530 --> 15:57.740
Makes sense.

15:58.040 --> 16:00.800
Since all the Batous want to stop,

16:01.150 --> 16:02.190
let's call off

16:03.030 --> 16:03.860
this scam.

16:05.220 --> 16:06.860
Then wouldn't all the money
we spent before

16:06.860 --> 16:07.820
be wasted?

16:08.940 --> 16:10.350
How could it be wasted?

16:10.700 --> 16:11.980
Not at all.

16:12.190 --> 16:13.320
It's all on your tab.

16:14.150 --> 16:14.910
Brother,

16:15.550 --> 16:17.010
forget about the emperor.

16:17.460 --> 16:18.150
It's over.

16:27.980 --> 16:29.580
What should we do, bro?

16:30.580 --> 16:32.420
Why aren't you anxious at all?

16:32.950 --> 16:35.810
They've left.
With just us, we won't be able to do it.

16:36.190 --> 16:38.130
Now that you have absolute confidence,

16:38.130 --> 16:40.260
you kicked everyone out immediately.

16:41.880 --> 16:44.280
What a tight plan.

16:44.790 --> 16:46.740
You know me so well now?

16:47.620 --> 16:49.090
So that's what it is.

16:49.110 --> 16:51.440
Kick them all out
so we can make more money.

16:52.270 --> 16:53.860
He doesn't care about money at all.

16:53.860 --> 16:55.270
Of course I do.

16:56.070 --> 16:57.740
I have such a huge debt.

17:00.250 --> 17:01.610
You can...

17:01.740 --> 17:03.670
-go to Miss Chen in Pangzhou—
-Hey!

17:05.210 --> 17:06.520
Why didn't I think of that?

17:06.520 --> 17:07.720
You have a

17:07.839 --> 17:10.390
rich friend, Miss Chen, in Pangzhou.

17:10.829 --> 17:11.760
Ask her for help.

17:11.770 --> 17:13.640
We're just regular friends.

17:14.040 --> 17:16.670
How could I have the nerve to ask her?

17:18.260 --> 17:20.020
If the friend in Pangzhou won't do,

17:20.020 --> 17:21.750
you can find the one in Pujiang.

17:21.869 --> 17:23.780
If not Pujiang, isn't there one in Suzhou?

17:23.780 --> 17:24.910
Anyway, you have many friends.

17:24.910 --> 17:26.700
You don't have to worry about
having no one to back you up.

17:26.700 --> 17:28.260
It also saves us

17:28.630 --> 17:30.060
from working for nothing.

17:30.060 --> 17:31.150
Don't go.

17:31.150 --> 17:32.700
I'm counting on you now.

17:35.020 --> 17:36.300
You still have Liang.

17:37.630 --> 17:38.350
Right.

17:40.830 --> 17:41.980
I will protect you.

17:47.020 --> 17:47.780
Let me go!

17:47.910 --> 17:48.710
Dakui, Erkui,

17:48.910 --> 17:50.220
how dare you arrest me!

17:50.540 --> 17:51.780
Be gentle, you two.

17:52.070 --> 17:52.540
Let me go!

17:52.540 --> 17:53.470
I'm not going in!

17:56.150 --> 17:56.910
Give me the keys!

17:56.910 --> 17:57.840
Give me the keys!

17:58.460 --> 17:58.910
Erkui!

17:59.300 --> 17:59.870
Let me go!

18:00.150 --> 18:01.060
Sorry, Madam.

18:01.150 --> 18:02.500
Dakui, give me the keys!

18:02.620 --> 18:03.950
Did you hear me, you two?

18:07.630 --> 18:08.740
Cao,

18:08.740 --> 18:10.290
you ungrateful bastard!

18:10.630 --> 18:11.390
Back then,

18:11.590 --> 18:12.980
if it weren't for my dad,

18:13.300 --> 18:15.190
you would've been turned into a human dog!

18:15.190 --> 18:16.020
Let me out!

18:17.220 --> 18:18.080
When will you be

18:18.460 --> 18:20.430
as clear-headed

18:20.560 --> 18:21.950
as I am?

18:22.430 --> 18:23.740
Then I'll let you out.

18:23.870 --> 18:25.830
Cao, let me out!

18:25.830 --> 18:27.170
My surname is Aisin Gioro.

18:27.170 --> 18:28.600
Aisin Gioro, you blockhead!

18:28.600 --> 18:29.910
You're the blockhead!

18:31.260 --> 18:32.260
Let me out!

18:33.460 --> 18:34.020
Master,

18:35.150 --> 18:36.080
from the eunuch.

18:38.050 --> 18:41.790
[Your Majesty, it's dangerous out there now.
Please secretly head to Yunhe Temple tomorrow; I have important matters to report.]

19:04.850 --> 19:05.680
Your Majesty!

19:06.830 --> 19:07.670
Your Majesty!

19:21.740 --> 19:22.540
Your Majesty,

19:22.630 --> 19:24.880
finding you and serving you

19:25.060 --> 19:27.730
makes my life complete.

19:32.100 --> 19:32.910
Look.

19:33.260 --> 19:34.060
This...

19:34.840 --> 19:35.910
Hurry up.

19:35.930 --> 19:36.970
Let's go.

19:48.060 --> 19:48.980
Your Majesty,

19:48.980 --> 19:50.260
your mansion

19:50.260 --> 19:52.460
is besieged on all sides.

19:52.590 --> 19:53.630
Mr. Shangguan,

19:53.630 --> 19:55.490
in order to stabilize all forces,

19:55.510 --> 19:57.110
disguised himself as you

19:57.300 --> 19:59.580
and continues to live in the residence

19:59.780 --> 20:01.300
to control the situation.

20:01.740 --> 20:04.700
This is what we call

20:05.190 --> 20:06.920
advancing secretly
while feigning a retreat.

20:06.920 --> 20:08.120
Your Majesty is wise.

20:08.160 --> 20:10.120
For now, just treat this Yunhe Temple

20:10.120 --> 20:13.120
as your temporary palace.

20:13.300 --> 20:14.870
What if there's another

20:15.300 --> 20:18.390
assassination attempt
at the old residence?

20:18.390 --> 20:20.300
Doggie will lead a team

20:20.430 --> 20:21.700
to guard day and night.

20:21.910 --> 20:23.740
I'm afraid

20:24.260 --> 20:25.220
my wife...

20:25.460 --> 20:28.700
Your Majesty, that's exactly
what I was about to ask.

20:29.060 --> 20:30.740
Do you want to invite

20:31.190 --> 20:33.980
Her Majesty here as well?

20:35.500 --> 20:36.260
Eunuch,

20:37.830 --> 20:39.430
what do you think?

20:45.630 --> 20:47.990
To say something treasonous,

20:48.430 --> 20:49.740
the less people know

20:49.980 --> 20:52.780
of this place, the safer.

20:53.460 --> 20:54.990
It's better Her Majesty...

20:57.520 --> 20:58.980
Forgive me, Your Majesty.

20:59.060 --> 21:00.110
You may rise.

21:05.350 --> 21:06.810
As for my beloved consort,

21:07.250 --> 21:09.510
how is she recovering from her injuries?

21:09.910 --> 21:11.080
Rest assured, Your Majesty.

21:11.080 --> 21:13.210
Miss Jiang is being well taken care of.

21:13.740 --> 21:15.670
She also instructed me,

21:15.690 --> 21:17.620
saying that Your Majesty loves...

21:18.340 --> 21:19.650
loves to drink this.

21:20.080 --> 21:20.650
Have a cup.

21:20.650 --> 21:21.820
No,

21:21.850 --> 21:22.980
put this down first.

21:23.010 --> 21:24.820
Put it down there.

21:29.460 --> 21:31.390
My beloved consort, she is so thoughtful.

21:31.390 --> 21:32.190
Your Majesty,

21:32.910 --> 21:34.780
you have finished washing up.

21:35.430 --> 21:36.870
We are ready to dress you.

21:38.260 --> 21:38.870
All right.

21:39.260 --> 21:41.120
Please take a look, Your Majesty.

21:54.740 --> 21:55.870
For me?

21:56.190 --> 21:57.260
Yes, Your Majesty.

21:57.740 --> 21:59.260
It is yours.

22:01.150 --> 22:02.060
Mine?

22:10.260 --> 22:11.670
Is this real?

22:11.740 --> 22:13.020
Your Majesty,

22:13.500 --> 22:15.110
all land under heaven belongs to you,

22:15.110 --> 22:16.980
and all people are your subjects.

22:17.150 --> 22:20.260
Who would dare to fake your dragon robe?

22:22.590 --> 22:25.020
I have liked yellow color
since I was a child.

22:25.020 --> 22:25.740
Yes.

22:26.220 --> 22:29.080
You will like it even more
once you are dressed in it.

22:40.410 --> 22:44.140
[A now extinguished fire broke out in Yimin Alley at night.
Fortunately, there are no casualties.]

22:44.670 --> 22:45.500
What?

22:47.830 --> 22:48.850
The old house is on fire?

22:48.850 --> 22:49.850
Let me take a look.

22:52.780 --> 22:54.580
Please calm down, Your Majesty.

22:54.590 --> 22:56.540
I will go check the situation

22:56.540 --> 22:57.980
and report back to you.

22:58.350 --> 22:59.150
Your Majesty!

23:00.020 --> 23:00.740
Lingyu!

23:02.700 --> 23:03.500
Your Majesty!

23:04.020 --> 23:05.880
The fire at the mansion last night

23:05.910 --> 23:07.740
must have been set intentionally.

23:07.740 --> 23:08.630
I saw

23:08.950 --> 23:10.540
many many men in black

23:10.540 --> 23:12.110
broke into the room.

23:14.020 --> 23:15.060
Mr. Shangguan...

23:15.060 --> 23:16.060
What happened to him?

23:16.060 --> 23:17.150
Mr. Shangguan,

23:17.350 --> 23:18.910
with his last breath,

23:19.590 --> 23:20.670
entrusted me

23:21.190 --> 23:23.320
to hand this letter to you personally.

23:23.830 --> 23:25.290
He said only with his death

23:25.430 --> 23:27.830
would those villains truly be at ease.

23:26.190 --> 23:27.640
[For His Majesty's personal receipt]

23:37.430 --> 23:38.760
Long live Your Majesty.

23:39.170 --> 23:40.500
The 29 armies in Peiping

23:40.500 --> 23:42.150
have all been arranged.

23:42.460 --> 23:45.060
Please ensure you depart tomorrow night.

23:45.350 --> 23:46.300
This check

23:46.540 --> 23:48.110
is all we loyal subjects

23:48.110 --> 23:49.190
have.

23:49.350 --> 23:51.410
To have helped you ascend the throne,

23:51.530 --> 23:53.890
I die without regrets.

23:55.540 --> 23:56.340
Your Majesty.

23:56.550 --> 23:58.110
My State Preceptor...

23:58.500 --> 23:59.300
Your Majesty,

23:59.540 --> 24:01.200
please take care of yourself.

24:01.830 --> 24:04.110
Only if you successfully ascend the throne

24:04.110 --> 24:06.110
will the State Preceptor's sacrifice

24:06.110 --> 24:07.190
be meaningful.

24:08.780 --> 24:09.300
How is

24:09.910 --> 24:10.780
the Empress?

24:11.630 --> 24:12.830
Rest assured, Your Majesty.

24:12.830 --> 24:13.590
Her Majesty

24:13.910 --> 24:15.910
has been safely moved
to a civilian residence,

24:15.910 --> 24:17.020
completely unharmed.

24:17.020 --> 24:18.390
For the sake of the big picture,

24:18.390 --> 24:19.220
I believe

24:19.590 --> 24:21.460
it is best for Your Majesty
and the Empress

24:21.460 --> 24:22.950
to return to Peiping separately.

24:22.950 --> 24:23.430
Yes,

24:23.430 --> 24:25.230
Miss Jiang is absolutely right.

24:25.460 --> 24:26.740
How about this, Your Majesty?

24:26.740 --> 24:28.780
You write a letter to Her Highness

24:28.870 --> 24:30.870
explaining the current situation.

24:31.260 --> 24:31.870
Also,

24:32.830 --> 24:34.160
have her cash this draft

24:34.190 --> 24:37.190
at the bank and deposit it

24:37.740 --> 24:39.190
under your name.

24:42.700 --> 24:43.460
That works.

24:46.260 --> 24:47.350
Lingyu risked her life

24:47.350 --> 24:49.190
to get this check back.

24:49.830 --> 24:50.830
I shall let Lingyu

24:52.010 --> 24:53.210
handle it for me.

24:55.260 --> 24:56.590
As you command, Your Majesty.

24:56.590 --> 24:57.460
Please write

24:58.020 --> 24:59.480
a letter of authorization

24:59.500 --> 25:00.900
yourself, Your Majesty.

25:01.430 --> 25:02.630
Bring me brush and ink.

25:02.630 --> 25:03.690
Yes, Your Majesty.

25:17.460 --> 25:18.320
I shall entrust

25:18.960 --> 25:20.920
this heavy responsibility to you.

25:22.350 --> 25:23.300
Rest assured, Your Majesty.

25:23.300 --> 25:24.100
Miss Jiang,

25:24.260 --> 25:25.500
you have to come back immediately

25:25.500 --> 25:26.960
after cashing this check.

25:26.980 --> 25:28.950
Tomorrow night,
you and the Fifth Master will accompany

25:28.950 --> 25:30.910
His Majesty to the Imperial City.

25:32.350 --> 25:33.480
I obey your command.

25:37.000 --> 25:37.720
Eunuch,

25:38.910 --> 25:39.740
what about you?

25:39.740 --> 25:41.110
I'm leaving tonight

25:41.110 --> 25:42.590
to set up security at the station.

25:42.590 --> 25:43.950
For Your Majesty's ascension,

25:43.950 --> 25:46.220
everything must be foolproof.

25:56.760 --> 26:00.290
This is the letter of authorization
written by Cao San himself.

26:17.150 --> 26:18.810
It is indeed exactly the same.

26:19.920 --> 26:22.990
It seems you have learned quite a lot
these past 2 years.

26:37.890 --> 26:39.130
This is for Lao Yang.

26:39.780 --> 26:41.300
This is for Cao San's wife.

26:50.530 --> 26:51.680
Why are you here?

26:52.120 --> 26:54.120
Please calm down, Madam.

26:59.070 --> 27:00.760
[To: Madam]

27:00.830 --> 27:04.190
[Check]

27:18.060 --> 27:19.120
As the saying goes,

27:19.780 --> 27:21.700
the Emperor guards the nation's gates,

27:21.700 --> 27:23.630
and the monarch dies for the state.

27:23.780 --> 27:26.500
His Majesty ascending the throne

27:26.560 --> 27:28.480
is a matter of national importance.

27:28.480 --> 27:30.810
We seek your understanding

27:31.130 --> 27:33.530
of His Majesty's good intentions.

27:33.950 --> 27:34.740
Eunuch,

27:35.220 --> 27:36.190
do you also think

27:36.740 --> 27:38.190
he is the Emperor?

28:09.130 --> 28:10.330
Who sent you?

28:11.760 --> 28:13.020
It was the Sect Leader.

28:14.460 --> 28:15.390
The Sect Leader?

28:15.740 --> 28:16.630
Yes.

28:16.830 --> 28:17.700
Impossible.

28:17.720 --> 28:19.480
You... You are talking nonsense.

28:19.480 --> 28:21.880
How could the Sect Leader
ask you to kill me?

28:21.960 --> 28:23.020
The Sect Leader...

28:23.180 --> 28:25.180
He told me to kill you, Madam.

28:27.060 --> 28:28.130
Words are no proof.

28:28.290 --> 28:29.050
I...

28:33.040 --> 28:34.040
I have a letter.

28:36.600 --> 28:37.560
[To: Yang]

28:51.500 --> 28:52.430
Madam.

28:53.150 --> 28:54.060
Impossible.

28:55.910 --> 28:56.910
Impossible.

28:57.780 --> 29:00.020
Cao San would never

29:00.680 --> 29:02.200
send someone to kill me.

29:02.440 --> 29:03.290
Madam.

29:03.430 --> 29:05.630
I have been in the palace for many years.

29:05.780 --> 29:07.260
The dragon throne

29:07.870 --> 29:09.590
is not for any mortal.

29:10.030 --> 29:12.590
That dragon throne is extremely cold.

29:12.830 --> 29:14.350
The heart of the one who sits on it

29:14.350 --> 29:15.300
is even

29:15.830 --> 29:19.390
colder than it.

29:21.460 --> 29:22.830
Cao San and I

29:23.540 --> 29:24.540
have been married

29:25.300 --> 29:26.780
for over 20 years.

29:28.330 --> 29:30.330
How could he bear to kill me?

29:31.750 --> 29:33.900
When he had no food as a child,

29:35.260 --> 29:37.020
I was the one who fed him.

29:37.500 --> 29:40.710
When the old Sect Leader almost
turned him into a human dog,

29:40.710 --> 29:42.710
my father saved him.

29:44.200 --> 29:46.330
How could he be so cruel?

29:46.630 --> 29:48.700
How could he kill me?

29:49.780 --> 29:50.700
Impossible.

29:51.060 --> 29:51.980
Impossible.

29:52.390 --> 29:53.260
Madam,

29:53.900 --> 29:56.470
you can draw a tiger's skin,
but not its bones.

29:57.070 --> 29:59.800
You may know a person's face,
but not their heart.

30:05.110 --> 30:06.630
Cao San...

30:18.950 --> 30:19.780
How is it?

30:20.080 --> 30:21.190
The money is gone.

30:23.660 --> 30:25.220
It's all... gone?

30:25.500 --> 30:26.630
Before you arrived,

30:26.640 --> 30:28.530
Mr. Cao's men withdrew the money.

30:28.680 --> 30:30.160
This is Mr. Cao's authorization letter.

30:30.160 --> 30:32.090
The account and password are on it.

30:38.670 --> 30:40.190
This darn Cao San.

30:40.460 --> 30:42.740
How could he draw all the money?

30:42.830 --> 30:43.460
This dog.

30:44.460 --> 30:45.700
He'll rot in hell.

30:45.790 --> 30:46.700
He'll rot!

30:47.280 --> 30:48.000
Let's go

30:48.020 --> 30:49.280
to the police station.

30:53.520 --> 30:56.270
[Shunxiang Teahouse]

31:09.460 --> 31:12.110
Are all the people in here clean?

31:12.260 --> 31:14.390
These are all your subjects.

31:14.670 --> 31:17.110
I didn't want to make such a big scene,

31:17.110 --> 31:18.540
but the Japanese

31:18.540 --> 31:20.190
have weapons.

31:20.540 --> 31:22.980
Your Majesty, the train leaves tonight.

31:22.980 --> 31:24.210
Once we reach Peiping,

31:24.210 --> 31:27.100
you will be the true Son of Heaven.

31:27.820 --> 31:30.300
Your Majesty, please rest here for now.

31:30.650 --> 31:32.540
Play some cards and have some tea.

31:33.060 --> 31:33.780
Your Majesty,

31:33.780 --> 31:34.780
Fifth Master and I

31:34.780 --> 31:36.510
will go arrange your schedule.

31:36.870 --> 31:38.220
I'll come back to pick you up

31:38.220 --> 31:39.500
in 4 hours.

31:40.110 --> 31:41.430
I shall take my leave.

31:45.780 --> 31:47.020
Wait.

32:11.500 --> 32:12.690
When this is done,

32:12.990 --> 32:15.120
I promise you a position below only one

32:15.980 --> 32:17.410
and above all others.

32:21.390 --> 32:23.590
Thank you for your grace, Your Majesty!

32:23.810 --> 32:24.680
Rise.

32:25.400 --> 32:26.810
And you, Miss Jiang.

32:27.740 --> 32:29.220
You saved my life.

32:29.410 --> 32:30.340
By then,

32:30.370 --> 32:32.890
I'll make you the Noble Consort.

32:34.740 --> 32:36.140
Thank you, Your Majesty.

32:36.870 --> 32:37.730
But Your Majesty,

32:37.730 --> 32:39.850
I do not seek such titles.

32:39.960 --> 32:41.360
I only wish to stay by your side.

32:41.360 --> 32:42.670
Serving you well

32:43.200 --> 32:44.730
is more than enough for me.

32:50.060 --> 32:50.890
History

32:51.450 --> 32:53.130
will remember today.

32:53.980 --> 32:56.980
-Long live the Emperor!
-Long live the Emperor!

32:57.000 --> 32:57.990
Go on with your work.

32:57.990 --> 33:00.250
-Yes, Your Majesty.
-Yes, Your Majesty.

33:06.030 --> 33:06.900
Chief,

33:06.930 --> 33:09.780
what did you mean

33:09.860 --> 33:11.660
by catching them in a trap today?

33:27.360 --> 33:28.430
Cao San?

33:33.190 --> 33:34.500
You are...

33:34.660 --> 33:37.460
I am Wang Zhicheng,

33:37.780 --> 33:39.290
Chief of the Yucheng Police Department.

33:39.290 --> 33:41.250
With you protecting me,

33:41.530 --> 33:42.920
I can rest easy.

33:43.130 --> 33:44.300
In the future,

33:44.320 --> 33:46.850
you'll be my Nine Gates'
Infantry Commander.

33:46.870 --> 33:48.790
You're here to...

33:48.810 --> 33:50.250
Have fun with the people.

33:54.670 --> 33:56.400
Do you know how to play mahjong?

33:57.240 --> 33:58.910
Come on, let's play.

34:12.760 --> 34:14.380
You know, governing a great nation

34:14.380 --> 34:15.980
is like cooking a small fish,

34:16.230 --> 34:18.139
it must be done slowly.

34:18.330 --> 34:20.250
These days,

34:20.270 --> 34:22.260
it's been hard for me to eat or sleep.

34:22.260 --> 34:24.050
After I ascend the throne,

34:24.070 --> 34:25.710
I will govern with all my might.

34:25.710 --> 34:28.120
Take Yucheng, for example.

34:28.150 --> 34:29.949
The public order is a total mess.

34:29.980 --> 34:31.909
The economy is failing too.

34:31.909 --> 34:32.980
The atmosphere is foul.

34:32.980 --> 34:34.500
This is highly improper.

34:35.270 --> 34:35.980
Kong.

34:38.159 --> 34:38.909
South Wind.

34:44.620 --> 34:46.070
Nine Gates' Infantry Commander.

34:46.070 --> 34:47.030
What's wrong?

34:49.219 --> 34:50.219
I've won.

34:50.900 --> 34:51.699
Good hand.

34:51.790 --> 34:52.830
It's all yours.

34:53.139 --> 34:55.139
But you must

34:55.170 --> 34:57.440
protect Her Majesty well.

34:58.140 --> 34:59.350
No matter what,

34:59.500 --> 35:02.270
Her Majesty is going to Peiping with me.

35:02.770 --> 35:03.920
She can't live without me.

35:03.920 --> 35:04.920
Rest assured,

35:05.200 --> 35:07.550
Her Majesty is with us.

35:07.570 --> 35:08.780
You will see her

35:08.810 --> 35:10.250
very soon.

35:10.370 --> 35:11.570
Good, good.

35:12.980 --> 35:14.180
But,

35:14.800 --> 35:17.730
Her Majesty must have complained
a lot to you, right?

35:17.920 --> 35:20.040
She said everything she should.

35:21.230 --> 35:24.540
Only believe half of what a woman says.

35:25.540 --> 35:26.750
Her Majesty said

35:26.770 --> 35:28.260
you really killed

35:28.280 --> 35:30.470
the old Sect Leader.

35:31.780 --> 35:34.220
That was a long time ago.

35:34.280 --> 35:35.650
What else did Her Majesty tell you?

35:35.650 --> 35:36.810
I heard

35:36.850 --> 35:39.400
you chopped off that old geezer's head

35:39.420 --> 35:40.940
with your own hands,

35:40.970 --> 35:42.890
and hung it in the hall for 3 days.

35:42.910 --> 35:44.470
I had to chop it off myself.

35:44.610 --> 35:47.000
The Beggar Sect must have its rules.

35:47.020 --> 35:48.350
How ruthless.

35:48.380 --> 35:50.310
Ordinary people couldn't do that.

35:52.660 --> 35:54.340
You are my historian, right?

35:54.850 --> 35:55.560
Yes.

35:56.960 --> 35:58.560
Then write it down in detail.

36:00.010 --> 36:03.270
A while ago, Lincheng's Beggar Gang leader
came to make trouble.

36:03.270 --> 36:05.140
And you put him in his place.

36:05.790 --> 36:06.710
You even know that?

36:06.710 --> 36:07.830
I was right there.

36:07.850 --> 36:09.290
Then I have to ask you.

36:09.380 --> 36:10.750
Did you see

36:10.780 --> 36:12.050
how I did it?

36:12.120 --> 36:14.920
Unfortunately,
I didn't see that with my own eyes.

36:15.430 --> 36:16.360
Write this down.

36:16.950 --> 36:19.980
At that time, 18 men by the river

36:20.460 --> 36:22.230
wanted to steal my empire.

36:22.260 --> 36:24.850
I took 2 short sabers,

36:24.940 --> 36:27.180
and slashed from one end
of the street to the other.

36:27.180 --> 36:27.980
The sabers...

36:28.830 --> 36:30.500
were all chipped.

36:30.740 --> 36:32.860
The ground was covered in blood.

36:32.970 --> 36:35.860
It squelched when you stepped on it.

36:36.330 --> 36:39.100
Guess why I wasn't hurt?

36:39.410 --> 36:40.450
Why?

36:40.650 --> 36:42.440
Highlight this part.

36:43.320 --> 36:45.250
It's because of the scar on my back—

36:45.770 --> 36:47.040
it's the dragon vein!

36:49.810 --> 36:51.140
Isn't that the scar left

36:51.180 --> 36:53.430
by the old Sect Leader

36:53.430 --> 36:56.390
when he tried to mutilate you
into a human dog?

36:58.110 --> 36:58.950
Insolent!

37:02.630 --> 37:03.630
What do you mean?

37:05.480 --> 37:06.730
What do you all mean?

37:06.980 --> 37:08.390
Are you trying to rebel?

37:27.310 --> 37:28.020
Brilliant.

37:28.310 --> 37:29.500
The Japanese

37:29.500 --> 37:31.140
would never have thought

37:31.140 --> 37:32.180
we would put on an act

37:32.180 --> 37:33.660
like this to escape.

37:33.660 --> 37:34.980
Who came up with this?

37:34.980 --> 37:36.430
This is too brilliant.

37:37.020 --> 37:39.660
Right, if we're acting,
let's do the full set.

37:39.660 --> 37:40.390
Don't just stand there.

37:40.390 --> 37:41.060
Who has handcuffs?

37:41.060 --> 37:42.580
Hurry up and cuff me.

37:42.580 --> 37:43.460
Cuff him.

37:43.460 --> 37:44.800
Hurry!

37:46.700 --> 37:48.370
I'll do it myself.

37:50.320 --> 37:52.600
What a great trick

37:52.950 --> 37:54.280
of advancing secretly.

37:54.390 --> 37:55.180
Come on.

37:55.210 --> 37:56.480
Arrest me.

37:57.060 --> 37:58.350
Escort me to Peiping.

37:58.390 --> 37:59.230
He talks too much.

37:59.230 --> 38:00.140
Take him down.

38:00.140 --> 38:00.940
Take him away.

38:01.430 --> 38:02.230
Take him away.

38:32.120 --> 38:33.960
Such a big scene.

38:35.030 --> 38:36.890
This isn't just putting on an act.

38:37.560 --> 38:39.390
This is putting on a full act.

38:46.460 --> 38:47.620
I am the Emperor.

38:48.140 --> 38:49.100
You know that, right?

38:49.100 --> 38:50.360
And I'm the Lord of Heaven.

38:50.360 --> 38:51.290
Kneel properly!

38:53.450 --> 38:54.530
I have to say,

38:54.560 --> 38:56.560
these guys are acting pretty well.

39:01.980 --> 39:02.870
Li Mazi,

39:02.870 --> 39:03.910
guilty of murder,

39:03.910 --> 39:04.950
arson,

39:04.950 --> 39:06.230
rape of women.

39:06.390 --> 39:07.750
Punished for multiple crimes,

39:07.750 --> 39:08.830
he is sentenced to death by shooting—

39:08.830 --> 39:10.430
to be executed immediately.

39:18.390 --> 39:20.540
Wang Dabao, guilty of murder

39:21.120 --> 39:22.320
and burglary.

39:22.660 --> 39:24.100
Punished for multiple crimes,

39:24.100 --> 39:25.220
he is sentenced to death by shooting—

39:25.220 --> 39:26.820
to be executed immediately.

39:32.480 --> 39:35.000
Peng Sanchuan, guilty of banditry,

39:35.050 --> 39:36.010
murder,

39:36.370 --> 39:37.440
robbery,

39:37.530 --> 39:38.610
and rape.

39:38.870 --> 39:40.020
He is sentenced to death by shooting—

39:40.020 --> 39:41.620
to be executed immediately.

39:43.100 --> 39:43.870
Liars!

39:44.130 --> 39:45.410
You're all liars!

39:48.260 --> 39:49.520
How could I be scammed?

39:49.980 --> 39:51.710
I am the Emperor!

39:55.800 --> 39:58.000
I wonder if Mr. Cao's General Longxiang

39:58.180 --> 39:59.020
is for sale?

39:59.020 --> 40:00.020
Greetings.

40:00.350 --> 40:01.500
And this is?

40:01.750 --> 40:03.100
I can only tell you

40:03.230 --> 40:04.460
his surname is Aisin Gioro.

40:04.460 --> 40:06.140
You're interested in this item?

40:06.140 --> 40:07.520
What you see may not be real.

40:07.520 --> 40:08.890
What you see is real.

40:08.960 --> 40:10.250
To see the mystery,

40:10.270 --> 40:12.400
the hidden dragon must reveal itself.

40:12.430 --> 40:15.540
Long live the Emperor!

40:15.540 --> 40:16.710
Did something grow

40:16.920 --> 40:18.560
on Sect Leader Cao's back?

40:18.620 --> 40:19.540
What grew?

40:19.750 --> 40:20.710
The dragon vein.

40:21.500 --> 40:22.310
It appeared!

40:22.310 --> 40:23.750
This is simply the will of Heaven!

40:23.750 --> 40:25.100
The dragon vein is finally continued.

40:25.100 --> 40:27.060
The Great Qing will not fall!

40:27.060 --> 40:28.910
The heavy responsibility of restoring
the Qing Dynasty

40:28.910 --> 40:30.750
now rests in your hands.

40:30.750 --> 40:31.870
When we get to Peiping,

40:31.870 --> 40:34.460
you will be the true Son of Heaven.

40:35.430 --> 40:36.020
Cao San,

40:36.580 --> 40:37.620
guilty of murder,

40:38.020 --> 40:39.180
child abuse,

40:39.580 --> 40:40.780
false imprisonment,

40:41.140 --> 40:42.470
and instigating theft.

40:42.710 --> 40:44.300
The facts of the crimes are clear,

40:44.300 --> 40:45.830
and the evidence is irrefutable.

40:45.830 --> 40:47.630
Upon trial by the Yucheng Court,

40:47.750 --> 40:48.750
you are sentenced

40:49.040 --> 40:50.170
to death by shooting

40:50.460 --> 40:52.180
and deprived of political rights for life—

40:52.180 --> 40:53.780
to be executed immediately.

40:54.500 --> 40:57.100
I am truly the only one
who sees things clearly.

41:46.180 --> 41:49.430
Here's the deed to the three-courtyard
house in the west of the city.

41:49.430 --> 41:51.290
The car is parked in the backyard.

41:51.830 --> 41:53.430
Everything promised before

41:53.580 --> 41:55.210
has been settled.

42:01.740 --> 42:02.850
Good job.

42:04.980 --> 42:07.100
Why does it feel like
something is missing?

42:07.100 --> 42:07.970
I remember now.

42:08.500 --> 42:09.870
There are 13 boxes of silver coins

42:09.870 --> 42:11.620
in Cao San’s warehouse.

42:11.710 --> 42:12.460
Where is the money?

42:12.460 --> 42:13.710
In your name,

42:13.740 --> 42:15.650
it was all donated to an orphanage.

42:15.650 --> 42:16.580
What did you say?

42:16.740 --> 42:18.870
The first rule of our Tianxiang Sect is

42:19.140 --> 42:20.060
unlawful money

42:20.230 --> 42:22.460
should be scattered in natural disasters.

42:22.460 --> 42:23.460
Bullshit!

42:23.460 --> 42:24.660
The brothers of our Tianxiang Sect

42:24.660 --> 42:26.580
risk their lives to make money,

42:26.700 --> 42:27.740
not to do charity.

42:27.770 --> 42:30.460
Shouldn't the Tianxiang Sect
be robbing the rich to help the poor?

42:30.460 --> 42:31.950
It's a good donation.

42:32.320 --> 42:33.690
This orphanage

42:33.720 --> 42:35.620
is better than 12 boxes of silver dollars.

42:35.620 --> 42:38.180
Thank you all for your strong support.

42:38.630 --> 42:41.060
Nanxi Orphanage opens today.

42:41.290 --> 42:43.210
For the homeless children,

42:44.180 --> 42:45.860
I thank you all.

42:57.080 --> 43:00.120
[Nanxi Orphanage Opening Ceremony]

42:57.470 --> 42:58.760
Nanxi...

43:00.540 --> 43:01.910
Why did you name

43:01.910 --> 43:03.230
the orphanage this?

43:03.260 --> 43:04.740
Is there a story behind it?

43:07.890 --> 43:10.090
Yanzi, I smashed the Xuande Jar for you,

43:10.210 --> 43:11.410
and I have no regrets.

43:14.720 --> 43:15.640
You brat.

43:15.660 --> 43:17.740
Let's settle our scores later.

43:20.830 --> 43:21.710
Second Batou,

43:22.270 --> 43:23.210
have you forgotten?

43:23.210 --> 43:26.290
Cao San still has some authentic pieces.

43:35.910 --> 43:37.190
I didn't expect

43:37.510 --> 43:39.470
he would really succeed.

43:39.490 --> 43:41.610
I thought he was just a greenhorn,

43:42.020 --> 43:44.460
but he turned out to be a nuisance.

43:45.570 --> 43:46.700
A nuisance?

43:48.000 --> 43:50.200
I actually find him quite interesting.

43:50.620 --> 43:53.420
The Sect Master placed
a troublemaker in the hall.

43:53.520 --> 43:55.250
Do you think he's being smart,

43:56.170 --> 43:57.920
or is he just getting senile?

44:10.020 --> 44:11.750
You've found a kindred spirit.

44:13.290 --> 44:15.400
When you are lost in the darkness,

44:15.420 --> 44:17.060
look to the light.

44:18.000 --> 44:20.230
When you've been in the dark for too long,

44:20.230 --> 44:22.100
someone has to crack it open

44:22.620 --> 44:23.950
to let the light in.

44:30.980 --> 44:31.710
Hey,

44:31.910 --> 44:33.180
I just remembered.

44:33.660 --> 44:36.120
Why didn't the old eunuch
who helped us come?

44:37.630 --> 44:39.070
He leaves after the deed is done,

44:39.070 --> 44:41.110
seeking neither fame nor credit.

44:43.500 --> 44:44.630
The eunuch is indeed

44:45.170 --> 44:46.500
a man of hidden talents.

44:46.520 --> 44:47.840
It's just a small trick.

44:47.840 --> 44:49.470
It must be a joke to you.

44:50.430 --> 44:51.350
Steady now.

44:51.980 --> 44:53.850
Don't bite off more than you can chew,

44:53.850 --> 44:55.980
and don't act before the time is right.

44:56.790 --> 44:58.660
I couldn't ask for more
than to join forces

44:58.660 --> 44:59.860
with the Fifth Batou.

44:59.980 --> 45:00.980
Join forces?

45:01.010 --> 45:01.590
I'm here too.

45:01.590 --> 45:03.050
Don't forget about Liang.

45:03.060 --> 45:03.830
Right.

45:04.020 --> 45:05.540
You still have Liang.

45:05.910 --> 45:07.060
For your

45:07.500 --> 45:08.310
Liang,

45:09.430 --> 45:10.910
stay alive

45:11.460 --> 45:12.720
in our Tianxiang Sect.

45:14.430 --> 45:15.750
What you did

45:15.750 --> 45:17.310
is truly a heroic act

45:17.330 --> 45:19.170
benefiting the country and the people.

45:19.170 --> 45:20.500
That's not quite right.

45:21.010 --> 45:23.340
We must credit your brilliance

45:23.370 --> 45:24.940
for catching that beast, Cao San.

45:24.940 --> 45:27.420
Otherwise, how many more children
would have suffered?

45:27.420 --> 45:28.350
Don't you agree?

45:29.040 --> 45:30.850
Since I met Sect Leader,

45:30.910 --> 45:32.350
things have been going smoothly.

45:32.350 --> 45:33.390
Rest assured.

45:33.390 --> 45:35.180
From now on, in this territory,

45:35.180 --> 45:37.500
we are in this

45:38.060 --> 45:39.140
together.

47:13.410 --> 47:15.410
[In the next episode]

47:15.460 --> 47:17.100
Are you human?

47:17.390 --> 47:19.020
Have you no humanity?

47:19.180 --> 47:20.390
People like Tang Yushan

47:20.390 --> 47:21.750
aren't scared of ghosts and deities.

47:21.750 --> 47:23.270
They won't buy it.

47:23.530 --> 47:24.770
He's not afraid of ghosts

47:24.770 --> 47:26.970
because he's never seen ghosts before.

47:29.560 --> 47:31.140
To seek justice for a dead person—

47:31.140 --> 47:32.340
is it worth it?

47:39.000 --> 47:39.890
I'll

47:40.330 --> 47:41.210
accept this round.
